              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "यदि प्रयत्नः दृढः, तर्हि सिद्धिः अवश्यं भविष्यति। yadi prayatnaḥ dṛḍhaḥ, tarhi siddhiḥ avaśyaṃ bhaviṣyati. If the effort is firm, success will surely come."
